&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Green LED - Low Power (3.9mcd, 2ma, 1.7Vf) - Digikey: 475-2709-2-ND&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Orange LED - Low Power (9.8mcd, 2ma, 1.8Vf) - Digikey: 475-1194-2-ND&lt;/li&gt;
