<text x="340.36" y="734.06" size="3.302" layer="94">2. Use 2(DDR3 512Mx16 Memory chips)x8Gb = 2GBytes, 
i.e. 2xH5TC8G63AMR-PBA(or K4B8G1646Q-MYK0)</text>
<text x="203.2" y="388.62" size="6.4516" layer="94">MicroSD</text>
<text x="134.62" y="187.96" size="3.81" layer="94" ratio="15">The power options are:</text>
<text x="127" y="167.64" size="3.81" layer="94" ratio="15">3. 5V by microUSB if no battery</text>
<text x="127" y="177.8" size="3.81" layer="94" ratio="15">1. 3.7V Battery</text>
<text x="134.62" y="182.88" size="3.81" layer="94" ratio="15">=======================</text>
<text x="134.62" y="193.04" size="3.81" layer="94" ratio="15">=======================</text>
<text x="203.2" y="441.96" size="6.4516" layer="94">Debug UART</text>
<text x="255.27" y="313.69" size="6.4516" layer="94">HDMI</text>
<text x="295.275" y="186.055" size="1.778" layer="214">Iset = 6800/Rs</text>
<text x="295.275" y="182.88" size="1.778" layer="214">Iset = 13k 523mA-&gt; 10k 680mA</text>
<text x="337.185" y="186.69" size="1.778" layer="214">Rs</text>
<text x="346.71" y="66.421" size="1.778" layer="214" ratio="15">Re</text>
<text x="318.77" y="32.131" size="1.778" layer="214" ratio="15">Rf</text>
<text x="342.9" y="74.676" size="1.778" layer="214" ratio="15">Vout = 0.6*(1+Re/Rf)
Re=150k
VDRAM=1.5V/1A,Rf=100K-1%
VDRAM=1.35V/1A,Rf=120K-1%
(Olinuxino : 4.99k/3.32k)</text>
<text x="410.21" y="313.69" size="6.4516" layer="94">Ethernet</text>
<text x="127" y="172.72" size="3.81" layer="94" ratio="15">2. 3.5-5V on VBat if not battery</text>
<text x="342.9" y="795.02" size="6.4516" layer="94">DDR3</text>
<text x="340.36" y="746.76" size="3.302" layer="94">1. Use 2(DDR3 256Mx16 Memory chips)x4Gb = 1GByte, 
i.e. 2xH5TQ4G63MFR-PBC(or K4B4G1646D-BCK0)  -&gt; Default</text>
